Hello {!Contact.FirstName},

Thank you for applying to Arizona State University. You meet academic requirements, but you have not yet met the English language proficiency standards.

You can be fully admitted to your ASU degree program by submitting a new TOEFL or IELTS score, or by enrolling in the ASU-ESL program (also known as AECP) and completing Advanced Level 2. Learn more by visiting http://esl.asu.edu/.

Although each student is reviewed individually, a majority of students admitted to ASU have a TOEFL score of 71 or higher. If you have any questions, please contact me by phone at {!User.Recruiter_Phone__c}.

If you have any questions, please feel free to contact me.

Sincerely,

{!User.Recruiter_Full_Name__c}
{!User.Recruiter_Title__c}
Admission Services
{!User.Recruiter_Email__c}
{!User.Recruiter_Phone__c}

If you have any additional information or questions related to this, please reply to this email.

{!Case.Thread_Id}
